      "blurb": "Water Release: Piranha Shark (D-Rank) and Shark Bomb (B-Rank)",
      "summonRole": "Water Shark",
      "biography": "<p><em>Water Release: Piranha Shark (D-Rank) and Shark Bomb (B-Rank) (Water Release Ninjutsu).</em> It uses your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC. You command it as a Bonus Action; it can take reactions it's able to, such as opportunity attacks.</p><p><strong>Medium Construct.</strong> <strong>Armor Class</strong> 14 + 1 for every rank above D-Rank · <strong>Hit Points</strong> 18 + 10 for every rank above D-Rank · <strong>Speed</strong> 0 ft..</p><p><strong>Abilities</strong> STR +4 (save +4), DEX +1 (save +1), CON +3 (save +5), INT −5 (save −5), WIS +0 (save +0), CHA −5 (save −5). <strong>Speed</strong> fly 30 ft., swim 90 ft. <strong>Damage Immunities</strong> Cold. <strong>Damage Resistances</strong> Fire. <strong>Damage Vulnerabilities</strong> Earth. <strong>Condition Immunities</strong> All Mental, All Physical, Exhaustion, Stunned, Petrified, Envenomed. <strong>Senses</strong> passive Perception 10.</p><p><strong>Linked to you when summoned:</strong> AC and hit points by the rank you cast the jutsu at, and your Ninjutsu attack bonus and save DC.</p>"
